\details{
The function reports:
\itemize{
\item Lag-1 autocorrelation
\item Ljung-Box test for overall autocorrelation
\item Augmented Dickey-Fuller (ADF) test
\item KPSS test
\item Linear trend estimation (slope and p-value)
